  "adjudication_note": "Chapter 10 of the apostila is titled `Alocação de Ativos e Rebalanceamento de Carteiras` and its sections are `Alocação de Ativos (Asset Allocation)`, `Macro e Micro-Alocação`, `Estratégica x Tática`, `Dinâmica x Estática`. The dictionary had no entry for any of them: `Alocação de Ativos` decomposed into `alocação` (action.allocate) plus `ativos` (entity.asset), which is two adjacent words, not the discipline the chapter is about. Registering the compounds is also what the corrected matcher makes reliable — under the old leftmost scan a compound only pre-empted its fragments when they started on the same token.",
